abstract: >-
  A community integer-multiplication research result with conditional
  kappa = 971668963/25000000000000 > 2^-15. Rohan Arun's final fixed-middle-basis
  composition builds on the attributed batching, partial-swap, semantic/bulk,
  two-stage and copied-center constructions. Includes written proofs, exact
  certificates and a completed conditional maintainer audit. The original
  OpenAI #109 framework remains assumed. No full formal verification,
  independent human peer review or worldwide priority is claimed.
